[al:新概念英语（三）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:Mary Had a Little Lamb]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]
[00:00.27]Lesson 16 | 第16课
[00:02.55]Mary had a little lamb | 玛丽有一头小羔羊
[00:10.19]Was Dimitri right to apologize to his neighbour? Why not? | 迪米特里向邻居道歉道歉对吗？为什么不对？
[00:15.03]Mary and her husband Dimitri lived in the tiny village of Perachora in southern Greece. | 玛丽和她丈夫迪米特里住在希腊南部的一个名叫珀拉科拉的小村庄里。
[00:25.07]One of Mary's prize possessions was a little white lamb which her husband had given her. | 玛丽最珍贵的财产之一就是丈夫送给她的一只白色小羔羊。
[00:31.82]She kept it tied to a tree in a field during the day and went to fetch it every evening. | 白天，她把羔羊拴在地里的一棵树上，每天傍晚去把它牵回来。
[00:39.40]One evening, however the lamb was missing. | 可是有一天晚上，羔羊不见了。
[00:43.27]The rope had been cut, so it was obvious that the lamb had been stolen. | 绳子被人割断了，很明显，羔羊是被人偷走的。
[00:49.52]When Dimitri came in from the fields, his wife told him what had happened. | 迪米特里从地里回来，妻子把发生的事情告诉了他。
[00:54.17]Dimitri at once set out to find the thief. | 迪米特里马上出发去找偷羔羊的人。
[00:58.91]He knew it would not prove difficult in such a small village. | 他知道在这么小的村庄里找到小偷不会很难。
[01:04.21]After telling several of his friends about the theft, | 把失窃的事告诉几位朋友之后，
[01:07.78]Dimitri found out that his neighbour, Aleko, had suddenly acquired a new lamb. | 迪米特里发现他的邻居阿列科突然多了一只小羔羊。
[01:15.19]Dimitri immediately went to Aleko's house and angrily accused him of stealing the lamb. | 迪米特里立即来到阿列科家，怒气冲冲地指责他偷了羔羊。
[01:22.68]He told him he had better return it or he would call the police. | 他对阿列科说，最好把羊还回来，不然就叫警察。
[01:27.61]Aleko denied taking it and led Dimitri into his backyard. | 阿列科否认偷了羊，并把迪米特里领进后院。
[01:33.03]It was true that he had just bought a lamb he explained, but his lamb was black. | 他解释说，自己确实刚买了一只羊，但他的羊是黑色的。
[01:40.35]Ashamed of having acted so rashly, Dimitri apologized to Aleko for having accused him. | 迪米特里为自己如此鲁莽行事感到羞愧，向阿列科道了歉。
[01:48.26]While they were talking it began to rain and Dimitri stayed in Aleko's house until the rain stopped. | 他们正谈着，天下起雨来，迪米特里便在阿列科家一直待到雨停。
[01:56.11]When he went outside half an hour later, he was astonished to find that the little black lamb was almost white. | 半小时后他出来时，惊奇地发现那只黑色的小羔羊几乎变成了白色。
[02:05.48]Its wool, which had been dyed black, had been washed clean by the rain! | 原来羊毛上染的黑色被雨水冲洗得干干净净！
